  "description": "Upgrade your family adventures with Roo Rev. This high-capacity electric cargo bike is built with a tough frame, strong motor, and powerful battery that work together to handle up to 400 lbs with ease (even uphill!), while its puncture-protected tires, torque cadence sensor, and front suspension fork act as your smoothest-ride-ever support system. This cargo bike’s upgraded Ananda complete e-system includes thoughtful details like integrated automatic lights with turn signals and brake light function, user-friendly visuals on a vivid color display screen, a USB port for charging your phone on-the-go, and more. Ready to take the kids for a spin? The accessory-ready rear cargo rack is compatible with the Thule Yepp 2 Maxi child passenger seat for rides to and from school, around the block, and weekend adventures. Combine with our Roo Rev passenger bars and Rev Foot Pegs (sold separately) for maximum comfort and safety. Load up, head out, and let Roo Rev do the heavy lifting while you enjoy the ride.",
